selection.", "token_count": 37, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "e2043c46-0c77-4a91-9003-0608b4db96f0", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "content": "Access a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to make informed choices. Responsibilities:", "token_count": 25, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "36219832-bce6-4bbd-8347-9280fc3763a3", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "content": "Priority-Based Swap Decisions: The user who listed first gets the first choice to finalize a swap from their leaderboard, ensuring fair and structured match resolution.", "token_count": 33, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "ae9725c0-1171-486c-9f39-b07ad2e0f33e", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "content": "Keep track of warranty expiration dates and schedule regular maintenance for your appliances and gadgets.", "token_count": 20, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 145, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\