"score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "e2043c46-0c77-4a91-9003-0608b4db96f0", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "content": "Access a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to make informed choices. Responsibilities:", "token_count": 25, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "f07ee3c1-ba47-490f-82d1-c9580f97047f", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "content": "Implemented the complete insurance flow, including document submission, policy details, and status tracking.", "token_count": 17, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "4bc17e78-0a7d-498d-8bba-cf053e9c9e50", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Responsibilities", "content": "Built resume upload and cover letter management features with seamless document handling and validation.", "token_count": 18, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 82, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented local folder management to store uploaded documents (PDFs/Images) in a structured and isolated directory.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>SUMMARY</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    SUMMARY :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Access a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to make informed choices. Responsibilities:\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented the complete insurance flow, including document submission, policy details, and status tracking.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Built resume upload and cover letter management features with seamless document handling and validation.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "Give me a comprehensive summary of all the key points across my uploaded documents.", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 180, "user_tokens": 18, "total_tokens": 291}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1599, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "Here\u2019s a concise summary of the key points that appear in the excerpts of your uploaded documents:\n\n1. **Document Management**\n   - Implemented a local folder system that stores uploaded PDFs and images in a structured, isolated directory for easy access and organization. *(source\u202f1)*  \n   - Built resume\u2011upload and cover\u2011letter management features that include seamless document handling and validation. *(source\u202f5)*  \n\n2. **Insurance Workflow**\n   - Developed the full insurance flow, covering document submission, policy details, and status tracking. *(source\u202f4)*  \n\n3. **User Experience Database**\n   - Provided access to a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services, enabling informed decision\u2011making. *(source\u202f3)*  \n\n4. **Overall Summary Section**\n   - The document includes a \u201cSUMMARY\u201d heading, indicating a high\u2011level overview of your qualifications and experience, though the detailed content of that summary isn\u2019t included in the provided excerpts. *(source\u202f2)*  \n\nThese points collectively highlight your expertise in React Native development, especially around robust document handling, end\u2011to\u2011end insurance processes, and leveraging user feedback data.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "d740efed-3817-46f6-9ec9-aa3cb71ced10", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-45fd78260e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "e2043c46-0c77-4a91-9003-0608b4db96f0", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "f07ee3c1-ba47-490f-82d1-c9580f97047f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "