seamless document handling and validation.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "Give me a comprehensive summary of all the key points across my uploaded documents.", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 180, "user_tokens": 18, "total_tokens": 291}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1904, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 213, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "**Comprehensive Summary of the Key Points in the Uploaded Documents**\n\n1. **Local Folder Management**  \n   - Implemented a structured and isolated directory system for storing uploaded documents (PDFs and images).  \n   - Ensures organized local storage of user\u2011generated files.\n\n2. **Resume & Cover Letter Features**  \n   - Built functionality for uploading resumes and managing cover letters.  \n   - Includes seamless document handling and validation processes.\n\n3. **Insurance Flow Implementation**  \n   - Developed the complete insurance workflow, covering:  \n     - Document submission,  \n     - Policy details presentation, and  \n     - Status tracking for users.\n\n4. **User Experience Database Access**  \n   - Integrated access to a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services.  \n   - Enables informed decision\u2011making based on collected feedback.\n\n5. **Summary Section**  \n   - The document contains a \u201cSUMMARY\u201d heading, but no detailed content is provided under it.\n\nThese points capture the main activities and responsibilities highlighted across the sections of the uploaded PDF.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "d740efed-3817-46f6-9ec9-aa3cb71ced10", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "sect