ough the excerpt does not include the actual summary content. *(Source\u202f2)*  \n\nThese points capture the main technical contributions and responsibilities highlighted in the provided sections of your \u201cMidhun React Native 4+.pdf\u201d file.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "d740efed-3817-46f6-9ec9-aa3cb71ced10", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-45fd78260e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "e2043c46-0c77-4a91-9003-0608b4db96f0", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "f07ee3c1-ba47-490f-82d1-c9580f97047f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "4bc17e78-0a7d-498d-8bba-cf053e9c9e50", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 2477, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 20, "results": [{"chunk_id": "4bc17e78-0a7d-498d-8bba-cf053e9c9e50", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "score": 0.44171392156732225, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "f07ee3c1-ba47-490f-82d1-c9580f97047f", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "score": 0.4385989053611028, "rank": 2}, {"chunk_id": "a6ed8177-6502-4d48-bad6-03783428b148", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf"