overing document submission, policy details, and status tracking. *(source\u202f4)*  \n\n3. **Resume and cover\u2011letter handling** \u2013 Built features for uploading resumes and managing cover letters, including seamless document handling and validation. *(source\u202f5)*  \n\n4. **User\u2011experience database** \u2013 Provided access to a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to support informed decision\u2011making. *(source\u202f3)*  \n\n5. **Summary section** \u2013 The document contains a \u201cSUMMARY\u201d heading, though no detailed summary text is provided in the extracted snippet. *(source\u202f2)*  \n\nThese points capture the main functional achievements and sections highlighted in the available excerpts of your \u201cMidhun React Native 4+.pdf\u201d file.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "d740efed-3817-46f6-9ec9-aa3cb71ced10", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-45fd78260e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "e2043c46-0c77-4a91-9003-0608b4db96f0", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "f07ee3c1-ba47-490f-82d1-c9580f97047f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "4bc17e78-0a7d-498d-8bba-cf053e9c