antically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented local folder management to store uploaded documents (PDFs/Images) in a structured and isolated directory.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>SUMMARY</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    SUMMARY :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Access a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to make informed choices. Responsibilities:\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented the complete insurance flow, including document submission, policy details, and status tracking.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Built resume upload and cover letter management features with seamless document handling and validation.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "Give me a comprehensive summary of all the key points across my uploaded documents.", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 180, "user_tokens": 18, "total_tokens": 291}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 2212, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 230, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "**Key Points from the Uploaded Documents**\n\n1. **Local Folder Management**  \n   - Developed a system to store uploaded documents (PDFs and images) in a structured, isolated directory. *(high relevance \u2013 Experience section, page\u202f9)*  \n\n2. **User Experience Database**  \n   - Provided access to a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services, enabling informed decision\u2011making. *(medium relevance \u2013 Experience section, page\u202f9)*  \n\n3. **Insurance Flow Implementation**  \n   - Built the complete insurance workflow, covering document submission, policy details, and status tracking. *(medium relevance \u2013 Experience section, page\u202f9)*  \n\n4. **Resume & Cover Letter Features**  \n   - Created resume upload and cover\u2011letter management capabilities, including seamless document handling and validation. *(low relevance \u2013 Responsibilities section, page\u202f5)*  \n\n5. **Summary Section**  \n   - The document contains a \u201cSUMMARY :\u201d heading but no detailed content under it. *(high relevance \u2013 Summary section, page\u202f1)*  \n\nThese points capture the main activities and responsibilities highlighted across the provided sections of your uploaded PDF.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Experience", "chunk_id": "d740efed-3817-46f6-9ec9-aa3cb71ced10", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-