"token_count": 1, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "94579d0a-1053-4a13-b8ef-ed17d762aef1", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 8, "section": "Experience", "content": "Intuitive UI/UX: Designed an engaging, gamified interface focused on discoverability, responsiveness, accessibility, and smooth user interactions. Responsibilities:", "token_count": 22, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "4b84ee12-ba7a-4c04-b12c-d8ebcfde86aa", "document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "RESPONSIBILITIES", "content": "Participated in code reviews, sprint planning, technical discussions, testing, debugging, estimation, and release activities.", "token_count": 18, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 68, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>2</page>\n  <section>RESPONSIBILITIES</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    RESPONSIBILITIES :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Access a comprehensive database of user experiences and feedback on various products and services to make informed choices. Responsibilities:\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Responsibilities\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>8</page>\n  <section>Experience</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Intuitive UI/UX: Designed an engaging, gamified interface focused on discoverability, responsiveness, accessibility, and smooth user interactions. Responsibilities:\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>3</page>\n  <section>RESPONSIBILITIES</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Participated in code reviews, sprint planning, technical discussions, testing, debugging, estimation, and release activities.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "What are the responsibilities in this role?", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 166, "user_tokens": 9, "total_tokens": 268}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1416, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The role\u2019s responsibilities include\u202f:\n\n- Participating in code reviews  \n- Taking part in sprint planning  \n- Engaging in technical discussions  \n- Conducting testing and debugging  \n- Performing estimation work  \n- Involvement in release activities  \n\nThese tasks are listed in the \u201cRESPONSIBILITIES\u201d section of the document (source\u202f5).", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "RESPONSIBILITIES", "chunk_id": "fb85d236-da14-4e51-8e6b-5478e81ca4b1", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-