content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    User\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Anonymous Swapping Logic: Users list items and anonymously like others' listings; mutual likes form swap candidates without revealing identities until listing ends.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>SUMMARY</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    SUMMARY :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>2</page>\n  <section>RESPONSIBILITIES</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    RESPONSIBILITIES :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "tell about the candidate", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 152, "user_tokens": 5, "total_tokens": 250}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1234, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 134, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "Based on the provided material, the candidate (named\u202fMidhul, as indicated by the document title \u201cMidhun React Native\u202f4+\u201d) has worked on the following areas:\n\n* **Performance tracking** \u2013 built features that keep job seekers informed by providing application\u2011status updates and notifications throughout the hiring process.  \n* **Anonymous swapping logic** \u2013 implemented a system where users list items, anonymously \u201clike\u201d other users\u2019 listings, and when two users mutually like each other they become swap candidates. Their identities remain hidden until the listing period ends.  \n\nThe documents list a \u201cResponsibilities\u201d section, but the specific responsibilities are not detailed in the extracted content.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Profile", "chunk_id": "b290c350-7b26-41c6-abb1-b5e98699514e", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "a14eedd2-5a68-42ad-b697-dc6c18913e9f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "0b306105-c86e-47fa-99a4-d794ed822c9c", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-45fd78260e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "RESPONSIBILITIES", "chunk_id": "fb85d236-da14-4e51-8e6b-5478e81ca4b1", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 2120, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 5, "results": [{"chunk_id": "b290c350-7b26-41c6-abb1-b5e98699514e", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "score": 0.30205076934579966, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "a14eedd2-5a68-42ad-b697-dc6c18913e9f", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "score": 0.27195835134490287, "rank": 2}, {"chunk_id": "0b306105-c86e-47fa-99a4-d794ed822c9c", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "score": 0.2544813263374155, "rank": 3}, {"chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-