ns.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Anonymous Swapping Logic: Users list items and anonymously like others' listings; mutual likes form swap candidates without revealing identities until listing ends.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>SUMMARY</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    SUMMARY :\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Boosts & Unlocks for Monetization: Users can pay to boost their listing\u2019s visibility or unlock additional swap candidates lower down the leaderboard.\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>7</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    User\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>Responsibilities</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Responsibilities\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "tell me about the candidate", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 160, "user_tokens": 6, "total_tokens": 259}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1620, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 104, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The context describes **swap candidates** as follows:\n\n- Users browse listings and can \u201clike\u201d items anonymously.  \n- When two users **mutually like** each other\u2019s listings, they become **swap candidates**.  \n- The identities of these candidates remain hidden until the listing period ends, preserving anonymity throughout the swapping process.  \n\nAdditionally, the platform offers **Boosts & Unlocks** for monetization: users can pay to boost their listing\u2019s visibility or unlock additional swap candidates that appear lower on the leaderboard.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "0b306105-c86e-47fa-99a4-d794ed822c9c", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "SUMMARY", "chunk_id": "6f7b18ba-5a84-4d17-b1ec-45fd78260e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "360da251-857a-4ae3-be55-0b175f13bc30", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "a14eedd2-5a68-42ad-b697-dc6c18913e9f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "8177355b-c628-43dd-a302-d4b444981907", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Responsibilities", "chunk_id": "399f4f3d-f3b8-4e9f-a291-59caca4be8c8", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 2461, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 20, "results": [{"chunk_id": "a14eedd2-5a68-42ad-b697-dc6c18913e9f", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4