 \nand\n \nnotification\n \nservices. \u25cf", "token_count": 18, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "beed194f-7943-4a75-93eb-4a1201e1cb9f", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Service", "content": "Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nApple\n \nPush\n \nNotification\n \nService\n \n(APNs)\n \nfor\n \nforeground,\n \nbackground,\n \nand\n \nterminated\n \napplication\n \nstates. \u25cf", "token_count": 30, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "75a574cf-a393-48ac-92e8-c2d2e8a55226", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "APNs", "content": "Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nAPNs\n \nfor\n \nwarranty\n \nreminders,\n \nmaintenance\n \nalerts,\n \nand\n \nuser\n \nengagement\n \nupdates. -Mobile\n \nDeveloper", "token_count": 29, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "4e31a72f-c557-457b-84f9-612e855251ab", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 8, "section": "Store", "content": "Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nAPNs\n \nfor\n \nAndroid\n \nand\n \niOS\n \nplatforms. \u25cf\n \nSupported\n \nApple\n \nApp\n \nStore\n \nand\n \nGoogle\n \nPlay\n \nStore\n \npublishing,\n \nrelease\n \nmanagement,\n \nand\n \nreview\n \nprocess\n \nactivities. \u25cf", "token_count": 44, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "1f22dbc4-8669-4a4f-b6c8-e2924718876a", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "Socket.io", "content": "Implemented\n \nWebSocket\n \nand\n \nSocket.io\n \nbased\n \ncommunication\n \nfor\n \nreal-time\n \nupdates,\n \nmatchmaking,\n \nnotifications,\n \nand\n \nuser\n \ninteractions. \u25cf", "token_count": 20, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 141, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<retrieved_context>\n\n<source id=\"1\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>APIs</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Integrated\n \nREST\n \nAPIs\n \nfor\n \njob\n \nlistings,\n \napplication\n \nsubmissions,\n \nuser\n \nprofiles,\n \nand\n \nnotification\n \nservices. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"2\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>6</page>\n  <section>Service</section>\n  <relevance>high</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nApple\n \nPush\n \nNotification\n \nService\n \n(APNs)\n \nfor\n \nforeground,\n \nbackground,\n \nand\n \nterminated\n \napplication\n \nstates. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>9</page>\n  <section>APNs</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nAPNs\n \nfor\n \nwarranty\n \nreminders,\n \nmaintenance\n \nalerts,\n \nand\n \nuser\n \nengagement\n \nupdates. -Mobile\n \nDeveloper\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>8</page>\n  <section>Store</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented\n \npush\n \nnotification\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n \nFirebase\n \nCloud\n \nMessaging\n \n(FCM)\n \nand\n \nAPNs\n \nfor\n \nAndroid\n \nand\n \niOS\n \nplatforms. \u25cf\n \nSupported\n \nApple\n \nApp\n \nStore\n \nand\n \nGoogle\n \nPlay\n \nStore\n \npublishing,\n \nrelease\n \nmanagement,\n \nand\n \nreview\n \nprocess\n \nactivities. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>2</page>\n  <section>Socket.io</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Implemented\n \nWebSocket\n \nand\n \nSocket.io\n \nbased\n \ncommunication\n \nfor\n \nreal-time\n \nupdates,\n \nmatchmaking,\n \nnotifications,\n \nand\n \nuser\n \ninteractions. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "How would system notifications be delivered to subscribers instead of using NotificationCenter's traditional observer API directly?", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 238, "user_tokens": 21, "total_tokens": 352}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 6397, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "System notifications can be delivered to subscribers through push\u2011notification services rather than by posting directly to\u202fNotificationCenter.  \n\nIn the projects described, the notifications are sent via **Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)** for Android and **Apple Push Notification Service (APNs)** for iOS. These services handle delivery to the device whether the app is in the foreground, background, or even terminated, allowing the app to receive the notification through the platform\u2019s push\u2011notification infrastructure instead of using NotificationCenter\u2019s observer pattern.  \n\n**Key points from the context**\n\n* Implemented push\u2011notification workflows using **FCM and APNs** for all app states (foreground, background, terminated)\u3010source id=\"2\u3011.  \n* The same approach was used for specific use\u2011cases such as warranty reminders, maintenance alerts, and user\u2011engagement updates\u3010source id=\"3\u3011.  \n* Support for both Android and iOS platforms was provided through these push services\u3010source id=\"4\u3011.  \n\nThus, by leveraging FCM and APNs, system notifications are routed to subscribers through the respective cloud\u2011messaging services rather than relying on NotificationCenter\u2019s traditional observer API.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "APIs", "chunk_id": "babd3fb1-3d03-42c3-963c-27d03cb3cd97", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Service", "chunk_id": "beed194f-7943-4a75-93eb-4a1201e1cb9f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "APNs", "chunk_id": "75a574cf-a393-48ac-92e8-c2d2e8a55226", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 8, "section": "Store", "chunk_id": "4e31a72f-c557-457b-84f9-612e855251ab", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "Socket.io", "chunk_id": "1f22dbc4-8669-4a4f-b6c8-e2924718876a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 6996, "status":