,\n \nExpo,\n \nExpo\n \nManaged\n \nWorkflow,\n \nExpo\n \nRouter,\n \nReact\n \nNavigation,\n \nReact\n \nNative\n \nReanimated,\n \nReusable\n \nComponents. State\n \nManagement:\n \nRedux\n \nToolkit,\n \nContext\n \nAPI. Mobile\n \nArchitecture:\n \nMVVM,\n \nMVC,\n \nModular\n \nApplication\n \nStructure,\n \nNavigation\n \nArchitecture.", "token_count": 60, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "5622ad51-0112-4318-ba49-0c2e6158b241", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "Native", "content": "React\n \nNative\n \nand\n \nTypeScript\n \nfor\n \nAndroid\n \nand\n \niOS. \u25cf\n \nImplemented\n \nreusable\n \nReact\n \nNative\n \ncomponents\n \nand\n \napplication\n \nmodules\n \nfollowing\n \nmaintainable\n \nand\n \nscalable\n \ndevelopment\n \npractices. \u25cf", "token_count": 32, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "954318a7-bb4d-4e73-9e8a-8794f7e33c38", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Native", "content": "React\n \nNative\n \nand\n \nTypeScript,\n \nincluding\n \njob\n \nsearch,\n \njob\n \napplications,\n \nprofile\n \ncreation,\n \nand\n \naccount\n \nmanagement. \u25cf", "token_count": 20, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "7ab45248-2c8d-43fb-ab73-168eab53bc47", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "React", "content": "Android\n \nand\n \niOS\n \nusing\n \nReact\n \nNative,\n \nExpo,\n \nExpo\n \nRouter,\n \nEAS\n \nBuild,\n \nand\n \nmodern\n \nReact\n \ndevelopment\n \npractices. \u25cf\n \nHands-on\n \nexperience\n \nwith\n \nTypeScript,\n \nReact\n \nHooks,\n \ncomponent\n \nlifecycle\n \npatterns,", "token_count": 34, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "989b9b9a-7b18-4a5d-a8c0-021cb6f2b8a8", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425