 \ndevelopment\n \npractices. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"3\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>5</page>\n  <section>Native</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    React\n \nNative\n \nand\n \nTypeScript,\n \nincluding\n \njob\n \nsearch,\n \njob\n \napplications,\n \nprofile\n \ncreation,\n \nand\n \naccount\n \nmanagement. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"4\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>React</section>\n  <relevance>medium</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    Android\n \nand\n \niOS\n \nusing\n \nReact\n \nNative,\n \nExpo,\n \nExpo\n \nRouter,\n \nEAS\n \nBuild,\n \nand\n \nmodern\n \nReact\n \ndevelopment\n \npractices. \u25cf\n \nHands-on\n \nexperience\n \nwith\n \nTypeScript,\n \nReact\n \nHooks,\n \ncomponent\n \nlifecycle\n \npatterns,\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n<source id=\"5\">\n  <document>\n    Midhun React Native 4+.pdf\n  </document>\n  <page>1</page>\n  <section>Reanimated</section>\n  <relevance>low</relevance>\n\n  <content>\n    React\n \nNative\n \nReanimated\n \nto\n \nprovide\n \nsmooth\n \nuser\n \ninteractions. \u25cf\n  </content>\n</source>\n\n</retrieved_context>", "user": "What are the responsibilities in the React Native role?", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 254, "user_tokens": 12, "total_tokens": 359}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1522, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The React\u202fNative role involves\u202f\u200b  \n\n*\u202fBuilding Android\u202fand\u202fiOS applications with **React\u202fNative and TypeScript**\u30104\u2020L1-L4\u3011.  \n*\u202fCreating **reusable React\u202fNative components and application modules** and following **maintainable\u2011 and scalable\u2011development practices**\u30102\u2020L1-L3\u3011.  \n*\u202fImplementing core app features such as **job search, job applications, profile creation, and account management**\u30103\u2020L1-L3\u3011.  \n\nThese responsibilities together cover the development of cross\u2011platform mobile apps, component\u2011level architecture, and the delivery of key user\u2011facing functionality.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "REST", "chunk_id": "3607e879-6130-42bb-96eb-92bc777ea21f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "Native", "chunk_id": "5622ad51-0112-4318-ba49-0c2e6158b241", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Native", "chunk_id": "954318a7-bb4d-4e73-9e8a-8794f7e33c38", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "React", "chunk_id": "7ab45248-2c8d-43fb-ab73-168eab53bc47", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 1, "section": "Reanimated", "chunk_id": "989b9b9a-7b18-4a5d-a8c0-021cb6f2b8a8", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 14374, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 20, "results": [{"chunk_id": "3607e879-6130-42bb-96eb-92bc777ea21f", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 3, "score": 0.6724759776415216, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "954318a7-bb4d-4e73-9e8a-8794f7e33c38", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "score": 0.6326683131838838, "rank": 2}, {"chunk_id": "7ab45248-2c8d-43fb-ab73-168eab53bc47", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", 