ontent": "Job\n \nSearch\n \n&\n \nApplications:\n \nJob\n \nseekers\n \ncan\n \nbrowse,\n \nfilter,\n \nand\n \napply\n \nfor\n \njobs\n \nacross\n \nmultiple\n \nsectors.", "token_count": 21, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 92, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<context>\n[Source 1] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: edad3e76-e698-4dea-ac81-61e470971181, Section: Application\nPerformance\n \nTracking:\n \nApplication\n \nstatus\n \nupdates\n \nand\n \nnotifications\n \nkeep\n \njob\n \nseekers\n \ninformed\n \nthroughout\n \nthe\n \nhiring\n \nprocess. \u25cf\n\n[Source 2] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: 663bad89-d9d5-4479-9426-5c222c602bbb, Section: Upload\nCover\n \nLetter\n \nSupport:\n \nUpload\n \nor\n \ncreate\n \npersonalized\n \ncover\n \nletters\n \nfor\n \njob\n \napplications. \u25cf\n\n[Source 3] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 3, Chunk: 57cfd0ba-8eb0-43c7-9527-216bc7b297c5, Section: Participated\nParticipated\n \nin\n \ncode\n \nreviews,\n \nsprint\n \nplanning,\n \ntechnical\n \ndiscussions,\n \ntesting,\n \ndebugging,\n \nestimation,\n \nand\n \nrelease\n \nactivities. \u25cf\n\n[Source 4] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: d38fe911-8e7f-4c7e-b463-cc7014244fdb, Section: Developed\nResponsibilities\n \n\u25cf\n \nDeveloped\n \nand\n \nmaintained\n \ncore\n \njob\n \nseeker\n \nworkflows\n \nusing\n\n[Source 5] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: 0168db26-f1ee-4f69-ae69-f9b55a75c3ad, Section: Job\nJob\n \nSearch\n \n&\n \nApplications:\n \nJob\n \nseekers\n \ncan\n \nbrowse,\n \nfilter,\n \nand\n \napply\n \nfor\n \njobs\n \nacross\n \nmultiple\n \nsectors.\n</context>", "user": "tell me about the candidate", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 182, "user_tokens": 6, "total_tokens": 281}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1469, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 201, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The candidate (Midhun) has experience building and maintaining a job\u2011seeker mobile application with React\u202fNative.\u202fKey points from the provided material include:\n\n* **Core workflow development** \u2013\u202fDeveloped and maintained the main job\u2011seeker workflows, handling tasks such as browsing, filtering and applying for jobs across multiple sectors\u3010Source\u202f4\u3011.  \n* **Application\u2011performance features** \u2013\u202fImplemented tracking of application status updates and notifications to keep job seekers informed throughout the hiring process\u3010Source\u202f1\u3011.  \n* **Cover\u2011letter functionality** \u2013\u202fAdded support for uploading or creating personalized cover letters for job applications\u3010Source\u202f2\u3011.  \n* **Team collaboration** \u2013\u202fParticipated in code reviews, sprint planning, technical discussions, testing, debugging, estimation and release activities\u3010Source\u202f3\u3011.  \n\nOverall, the candidate\u2019s work focuses on end\u2011to\u2011end job\u2011search features, performance monitoring, and collaborative development practices within a React\u202fNative environment.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Application", "chunk_id": "edad3e76-e698-4dea-ac81-61e470971181", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-