n:\n \nUsers\n \ncan\n \npay\n \nto\n \nboost\n \ntheir\n \nlisting\u2019s\n \nvisibility\n \nor\n \nunlock\n \nadditional\n \nswap\n \ncandidates\n \nlower\n \ndown\n \nthe\n \nleaderboard. \u25cf", "token_count": 30, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "663bad89-d9d5-4479-9426-5c222c602bbb", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Upload", "content": "Cover\n \nLetter\n \nSupport:\n \nUpload\n \nor\n \ncreate\n \npersonalized\n \ncover\n \nletters\n \nfor\n \njob\n \napplications. \u25cf", "token_count": 17, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "89089fb4-44c6-47f9-b105-b22ac0d030aa", "document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Receive", "content": "Receive\n \nreviews\n \nfrom\n \ntrusted\n \nsources\n \nlike\n \nfriends\n \nand\n \nfamily\n \nto\n \nmake\n \ninformed\n \ndecisions\n \nabout\n \nproducts. \u25cf", "token_count": 21, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 123, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<context>\n[Source 1] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: edad3e76-e698-4dea-ac81-61e470971181, Section: Application\nPerformance\n \nTracking:\n \nApplication\n \nstatus\n \nupdates\n \nand\n \nnotifications\n \nkeep\n \njob\n \nseekers\n \ninformed\n \nthroughout\n \nthe\n \nhiring\n \nprocess. \u25cf\n\n[Source 2] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 7, Chunk: bdc2e8f0-07be-4f14-b6a5-bc241ee006c9, Section: The\nPriority-Based\n \nSwap\n \nDecisions:\n \nThe\n \nuser\n \nwho\n \nlisted\n \nfirst\n \ngets\n \nthe\n \nfirst\n \nchoice\n \nto\n \nfinalize\n \na\n \nswap\n \nfrom\n \ntheir\n \nleaderboard,\n \nensuring\n \nfair\n \nand\n \nstructured\n \nmatch\n \nresolution. \u25cf\n\n[Source 3] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 7, Chunk: d19d6b56-ea73-4c05-a76e-296136991e6a, Section: Users\nBoosts\n \n&\n \nUnlocks\n \nfor\n \nMonetization:\n \nUsers\n \ncan\n \npay\n \nto\n \nboost\n \ntheir\n \nlisting\u2019s\n \nvisibility\n \nor\n \nunlock\n \nadditional\n \nswap\n \ncandidates\n \nlower\n \ndown\n \nthe\n \nleaderboard. \u25cf\n\n[Source 4] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 5, Chunk: 663bad89-d9d5-4479-9426-5c222c602bbb, Section: Upload\nCover\n \nLetter\n \nSupport:\n \nUpload\n \nor\n \ncreate\n \npersonalized\n \ncover\n \nletters\n \nfor\n \njob\n \napplications. \u25cf\n\n[Source 5] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 9, Chunk: 89089fb4-44c6-47f9-b105-b22ac0d030aa, Section: Receive\nReceive\n \nreviews\n \nfrom\n \ntrusted\n \nsources\n \nlike\n \nfriends\n \nand\n \nfamily\n \nto\n \nmake\n \ninformed\n \ndecisions\n \nabout\n \nproducts. \u25cf\n</context>", "user": "tell me about the candidate", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 214, "user_tokens": 6, "total_tokens": 313}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1060, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 128, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The app refers to **candidates** as the other users that appear on a\u202fleaderboard for a swap.  \n\n- **Swap candidates** are the people a user can match with when they want to exchange listings.  \n- By default only the top\u2011ranked candidates are available, but **users can pay to unlock additional swap candidates that are lower down the leaderboard**\u3010Source\u202f3\u3011.  \n- The **priority\u2011based swap decision** rule gives the user who listed first the first right to finalize a swap with a candidate from their leaderboard, ensuring a fair and structured match\u2011resolution process\u3010Source\u202f2\u3011.  ", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Application", "chunk_id": "edad3e76-e698-4dea-ac81-61e470971181", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "The", "chunk_id": "bdc2e8f0-07be-4f14-b6a5-bc241ee006c9", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 7, "section": "Users", "chunk_id": "d19d6b56-ea73-4c05-a76e-296136991e6a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Upload", "chunk_id": "663bad89-d9d5-4479-9426-5c222c602bbb", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Receive", "chunk_id": "89089fb4-44c6-47f9-b105-b22ac0d030aa", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 2048, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 20, "results": [{"chunk_id": "edad3e76-e698-4dea-ac81-61e470971181", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "score": 0.2642723257990566, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "663bad89-d9d5-4479-9426-5c222c602bbb", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 5, "score": 0.2079887678119352, "rank": 2}, {"chunk_id": "57cfd0ba-8eb0-43c7-9527-216bc7b297c5", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 3, "score": 0.2040468560770213, "rank": 3}, {"chun