 \nlisted\n \nfirst\n \ngets\n \nthe\n \nfirst\n \nchoice\n \nto\n \nfinalize\n \na\n \nswap\n \nfrom\n \ntheir\n \nleaderboard,\n \nensuring\n \nfair\n \nand\n \nstructured\n \nmatch\n \nresolution. \u25cf", "token_count": 34, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}], "total_tokens": 101, "chunk_count": 5, "document_count": 1}, "prompt": {"system": "You are a RAG assistant. Answer the user's question using ONLY the provided context.\n\nUnderstand the question semantically and consider relevant information from different perspectives within the context. Do not rely on outside knowledge, assumptions, or hallucinations.\n\nIf the answer is not supported by the context, say: \"I couldn't find that information in the provided context.\"\n\nGive a clear, direct answer and include relevant details from the context when useful.", "context": "<context>\n[Source 1] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 9, Chunk: 89089fb4-44c6-47f9-b105-b22ac0d030aa, Section: Receive\nReceive\n \nreviews\n \nfrom\n \ntrusted\n \nsources\n \nlike\n \nfriends\n \nand\n \nfamily\n \nto\n \nmake\n \ninformed\n \ndecisions\n \nabout\n \nproducts. \u25cf\n\n[Source 2] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 2, Chunk: 36842fae-ce6d-44e2-808f-087b937f808c, Section: Experience\nExperience\n \nimplementing\n \ndeep\n \nlinking,\n \nauthentication,\n \nbiometric\n \nauthentication,\n \npayment\n \nintegrations,\n \nand\n \nthird-party\n \nmobile\n \nservices. \u25cf\n\n[Source 3] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 3, Chunk: 57cfd0ba-8eb0-43c7-9527-216bc7b297c5, Section: Participated\nParticipated\n \nin\n \ncode\n \nreviews,\n \nsprint\n \nplanning,\n \ntechnical\n \ndiscussions,\n \ntesting,\n \ndebugging,\n \nestimation,\n \nand\n \nrelease\n \nactivities. \u25cf\n\n[Source 4] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 8, Chunk: 5212e0db-29df-4dec-ae52-1302147ccbc3, Section: Optimized\nOptimized\n \nanimations\n \nand\n \nuser\n \ninteractions\n \nusing\n\n[Source 5] Document: Midhun React Native 4+.pdf, Page: 7, Chunk: bdc2e8f0-07be-4f14-b6a5-bc241ee006c9, Section: The\nPriority-Based\n \nSwap\n \nDecisions:\n \nThe\n \nuser\n \nwho\n \nlisted\n \nfirst\n \ngets\n \nthe\n \nfirst\n \nchoice\n \nto\n \nfinalize\n \na\n \nswap\n \nfrom\n \ntheir\n \nleaderboard,\n \nensuring\n \nfair\n \nand\n \nstructured\n \nmatch\n \nresolution. \u25cf\n</context>", "user": "tell about the person", "system_tokens": 93, "context_tokens": 192, "user_tokens": 5, "total_tokens": 290}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 1118, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 174, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The person described in the provided material is a mobile\u2011development professional with extensive experience in React\u202fNative. Their background includes:\n\n* **Technical experience** \u2013 they have implemented deep linking, authentication (including biometric authentication), payment integrations, and various third\u2011party mobile services.  \n* **Team involvement** \u2013 they regularly take part in code reviews, sprint planning, technical discussions, testing, debugging, effort estimation, and release activities.  \n* **Performance optimisation** \u2013 they have worked on optimizing animations and user interactions to improve the overall app experience.  \n* **Decision\u2011making process** \u2013 they follow a priority\u2011based swap system where the user listed first on a leaderboard gets the first choice to finalize a swap, ensuring fair and structured match resolution.  \n\nThese points collectively portray a developer who is skilled in both building complex mobile features and collaborating effectively within a development team.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "077beb34-aaa5-4ea8-a4b4-98f7f6c8425b", "document_name": "Midhun React Native 4+.pdf", "page": 9, "section": "Receive", "chunk_id": "89089fb4-44c6-47f9-b105-b22ac0d030aa", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "