IdentifierConvertible\nA protocol for uniquely identifying publisher streams. struct CombineIdentifier\nA unique identifier for identifying publisher streams. Debugging Identifiers\n</context>", "user": "What are the benefits of adopting Combine in your code?", "system_tokens": 105, "context_tokens": 512, "user_tokens": 13, "total_tokens": 630}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 888, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 39, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "Adopting Combine makes your code\u202feasier to read and maintain by centralizing event\u2011processing logic and removing the need for nested closures and convention\u2011based callbacks\u202f[Source\u202f3].", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "section": null, "chunk_id": "0725be3e-f12c-40f7-b124-101a41eaf47f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "section": null, "chunk_id": "eb603e2c-4ed9-42e6-b039-92056b6c568e", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 2, "section": "Combine", "chunk_id": "2e1daa1b-ece7-4af3-99a3-04b479fc879b", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 5, "section": "Schedulers", "chunk_id": "adc2e3af-3e16-40a0-a2fa-ccd4e3c069a8", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Using Combine for Your App\u02bcs Asynchronous Code", "chunk_id": "e1f33e2b-8b41-4e9a-ac31-9f392f45f238", "retrieval_