oordinate when publishers start sending elements to subscribers. protocol ConnectablePublisher\nA publisher that provides an explicit means of connecting and canceling publication.\n\n[Source 5] Document: Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf, Page: 4, Chunk: ad2ad6a2-e768-43f9-a28f-86929b6041d0, Section: Subscribers\nle value and publishes a new element whenever the value\nchanges. class PassthroughSubject\nA subject that broadcasts elements to downstream subscribers. protocol Scheduler\nA protocol that defines when and how to execute a closure. struct ImmediateScheduler\nA scheduler for performing synchronous actions. Subjects\nSchedulers\nprotocol SchedulerTimeIntervalConvertible\nA protocol that provides a scheduler with an expression for relative time.\n</context>", "user": "What does the Subscriber protocol declare?", "system_tokens": 105, "context_tokens": 512, "user_tokens": 8, "total_tokens": 625}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 726, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 21, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The\u202fSubscriber\u202fprotocol declares a type that can receive input from a publisher\u3010Source\u202f1\u3011.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "Controlling Publishing with Connectable Publishers", "chunk_id": "71a5e0c9-96df-4809-9d7c-e4e39eebcb38", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Subscribers", "chunk_id": "a68a13c0-41b2-4f66-820b-d0638841b05f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Using Combine for Your App\u02bcs Asynchronous Code", "chunk_id": "e1f33e2b-