uler for performing synchronous actions. Subjects\nSchedulers\nprotocol SchedulerTimeIntervalConvertible\nA protocol that provides a scheduler with an expression for relative time.\n</context>", "user": "What does the Subscriber protocol declare?", "system_tokens": 105, "context_tokens": 512, "user_tokens": 8, "total_tokens": 625}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 677, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 27, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The\u202fSubscriber\u202fprotocol is defined as a protocol that declares a type capable of receiving input from a publisher\u3010Source 1\u3011.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "Controlling Publishing with Connectable Publishers", "chunk_id": "71a5e0c9-96df-4809-9d7c-e4e39eebcb38", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Subscribers", "chunk_id": "a68a13c0-41b2-4f66-820b-d0638841b05f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Using Combine for Your App\u02bcs Asynchronous Code", "chunk_id": "e1f33e2b-8b41-4e9a-ac31-9f392f45f238", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "Publishers", "chunk_id": "d9f2ebad-d428-47d1-8da0-12cde93f279a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Subscribers", "chunk_id": "ad2ad6a2-e768-43f9-a28f-86929b6041d0", "retrieval_method": "final", 