the text to\nperform URL requests. You can then use another publisher to process the responses and\nOverview\nFramework\nCombine\nCustomize handling of asynchronous events by combining event-\nprocessing operators. iOS 13.0+ iPadOS 13.0+ Mac Catalyst 13.0+macOS 10.15+ tvOS 13.0+ visionOS 1.0+\nwatchOS 6.0+\nDocumentation Language:Swift\nuse them to update your app.\n</context>", "user": "What does a Subscriber do at the end of a chain of publishers?", "system_tokens": 105, "context_tokens": 204, "user_tokens": 17, "total_tokens": 326}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 784, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 31, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "At the end of a chain of publishers, a\u202fSubscriber\u202facts on the elements it receives, processing them as they arrive.\u3010Source\u202f1\u3011", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "section": null, "chunk_id": "f8aa5f53-44af-4282-9763-ee84f213ae70", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "section": null, "chunk_id": "b8facd33-692a-4ffd-9f3e-168f3f78d04f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 786, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": null, "bm25": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 2, "query_terms": ["what", "does", "a", "subscriber", "do", "at", "the", "end", "of", "a", "chain", "of", "publishers"], "results": [{"chunk_id": "f8aa5f53-44af-4282-9763-ee84f213ae70", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "score": 13.312622153328073, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "b8facd33-692a-4ffd-9f3e-168f3f78d04f", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 1, "score": 0.9498115437925924, "rank": 2}]}, "rrf": null, "reranker": 