"907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "Publishers", "content": "never publishes any values, and optionally finishes immediately. struct Fail\nA publisher that immediately terminates with the specified error. struct Record\nA publisher that allows for recording a series of inputs and a completion, for later\nplayback to each subscriber. Controlling Publishing with Connectable Publishers\nCoordinate when publishers start sending elements to subscribers. protocol ConnectablePublisher\nA publisher that provides an explicit means of connecting and canceling publication.", "token_count": 89, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "e1f33e2b-8b41-4e9a-ac31-9f392f45f238", "document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Using Combine for Your App\u02bcs Asynchronous Code", "content": "r that exposes its elements as a throwing asynchronous sequence. Combine Migration\nObservable Objects\nAsynchronous Publishers\nEncoders and Decoders\nprotocol TopLevelEncoder\nA type that defines methods for encoding. protocol TopLevelDecoder\nA type that defines methods for decoding. protocol CustomCombineIdentifierConvertible\nA protocol for uniquely identifying publisher streams. struct CombineIdentifier\nA unique identifier for identifying publisher streams. Debugging Identifiers", "token_count": 76, "score": 0.0, "method": "final"}, {"chunk_id": "ad2ad6a2-e768-43f9-a28f-86929b6041d0", "document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Subscribers", "content": "le value and publishes a new element whenever the value\nchanges. class PassthroughSubject\nA subject that broadcasts elements to downstream subscribers. protocol Scheduler\nA protocol that defines when and how to execute a closure. struct ImmediateSchedule