ing publisher streams. struct CombineIdentifier\nA unique identifier for identifying publisher streams. Debugging Identifiers\n\n[Source 3] Document: Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf, Page: 4, Chunk: ad2ad6a2-e768-43f9-a28f-86929b6041d0, Section: Subscribers\nle value and publishes a new element whenever the value\nchanges. class PassthroughSubject\nA subject that broadcasts elements to downstream subscribers. protocol Scheduler\nA protocol that defines when and how to execute a closure. struct ImmediateScheduler\nA scheduler for performing synchronous actions. Subjects\nSchedulers\nprotocol SchedulerTimeIntervalConvertible\nA protocol that provides a scheduler with an expression for relative time.\n</context>", "user": "What does the Publisher protocol declare?", "system_tokens": 105, "context_tokens": 309, "user_tokens": 8, "total_tokens": 422}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 695, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 11, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "I could not find that information in the provided documents.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": "Publishers", "chunk_id": "d9f2ebad-d428-47d1-8da0-12cde93f279a", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": "Using Combine for Your App\u02bcs Asynchronous Code", "chunk_id": "e1f33e2b-8b41-4e9a-ac31-9f392f45f238", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": "Subscribers", "chunk_id": "ad2ad6a2-e768-43f9-a28f-86929b6041d0", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 760, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_searc