ing publisher streams. struct CombineIdentifier\nA unique identifier for identifying publisher streams. Debugging Identifiers\n\n[Source 3] Document: Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf, Page: 3\ninputs and a completion, for later\nplayback to each subscriber. Controlling Publishing with Connectable Publishers\nCoordinate when publishers start sending elements to subscribers. protocol ConnectablePublisher\nA publisher that provides an explicit means of connecting and canceling publication. Processing Published Elements with Subscribers\nApply back pressure\u00a0to precisely control when publishers produce elements.\n</context>", "user": "What is CustomCombineIdentifierConvertible used for?", "system_tokens": 182, "context_tokens": 213, "user_tokens": 6, "total_tokens": 401}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 2055, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 27, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "CustomCombineIdentifierConvertible is a protocol that provides a way to uniquely identify publisher streams.\u202f[Source\u202f1][Source\u202f2]", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": null, "chunk_id": "4b7ab32f-3558-4324-a5e9-10fb504a014d", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 5, "section": null, "chunk_id": "080b4948-73b0-49fb-aab6-ba7a07c20fa7", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "section": null, "chunk_id": "d0a6e5b5-0539-401c-bf92-e8575a609305", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 2359, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 3, "results": [{"chu