upstream publishers\nand republish them. At the end of a chain of publishers, a Subscriber acts on elements as it receives them. Publishers only emit values when explicitly requested to do so by subscribers. This puts\nyour subscriber code in control of how fast it receives events from the publishers it\u02bcs\nconnected to.\n\n[Source 3] Document: Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf, Page: 6\nle value and publishes a new element whenever the value\nchanges. class PassthroughSubject\nA subject that broadcasts elements to downstream subscribers. protocol Scheduler\nA protocol that defines when and how to execute a closure. struct ImmediateScheduler\nA scheduler for performing synchronous actions.\n</context>", "user": "What does the Publisher protocol declare?", "system_tokens": 182, "context_tokens": 270, "user_tokens": 8, "total_tokens": 460}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 694, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 11, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "I could not find that information in the provided documents.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": null, "chunk_id": "7e4405e2-54bd-460b-8609-b218847d733f", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 2, "section": null, "chunk_id": "acd3d9b2-5d51-4a89-8311-6192ad9eee7c", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": null, "chunk_id": "03b815a5-f2e1-49ab-9787-ed569c2a0376", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 889, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 3, "results": [{"chunk_id": "7e4405