tifierConvertible\nA protocol for uniquely identifying publisher streams.\n</context>", "user": "What does the Subject protocol provide?", "system_tokens": 182, "context_tokens": 256, "user_tokens": 8, "total_tokens": 446}, "llm": {"provider": "groq", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "latency_ms": 461, "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": 29, "total_tokens": null, "answer": "The **Subject** protocol is defined as a publisher that **exposes a method for outside callers to publish elements**\u3010Source\u202f1\u3011.", "status": "completed"}, "sources": [{"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 5, "section": null, "chunk_id": "25e7b0a2-a776-4fd3-85d2-f39820d08e50", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "section": null, "chunk_id": "03b815a5-f2e1-49ab-9787-ed569c2a0376", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}, {"document_id": "907f917b-3caa-4157-b94d-208635baaea9", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "section": null, "chunk_id": "4b7ab32f-3558-4324-a5e9-10fb504a014d", "retrieval_method": "final", "score": 0.0}], "total_latency_ms": 613, "status": "completed", "error": null, "vector_search": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 3, "results": [{"chunk_id": "03b815a5-f2e1-49ab-9787-ed569c2a0376", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 6, "score": 0.44020918819619986, "rank": 1}, {"chunk_id": "4b7ab32f-3558-4324-a5e9-10fb504a014d", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 4, "score": 0.4045957021334788, "rank": 2}, {"chunk_id": "d0a6e5b5-0539-401c-bf92-e8575a609305", "document_name": "Combine | Apple Developer Documentation.pdf", "page": 3, "score": 0.3713992938381328, "rank": 3}]}, "bm25": {"latency_ms": 0, "chunk_count": 3, "query_terms": ["what", "